ted)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1NYlTBoWfld6l2MXdjOE8vVPMFQ.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'erba cattiva","overview":"Wael è un truffatore e convive con Monique, sua complice e madre adottiva. La loro vita cambia dopo aver tentato di truffare Victor, un vecchio amico di Monique, a capo di un progetto di rieducazione di adolescenti con problemi scolastici."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Bad Seeds","overview":"Wael, a former street child, makes a living from small scams with his adoptive mother and partner-in-crime Monique. When this unconventional duo swindles the wrong guy, Victor, an old acquaintance of Monique now in charge of a support organization for troubled teens, they have no choice but to become his interim secretary and educator in order to redeem themselves."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Waël, un ancien enfant des rues, vit en banlieue parisienne de petites arnaques qu’il commet avec Monique, une femme à la retraite qui tient visiblement beaucoup à lui.  Sa vie prend un tournant le jour où un ami de cette dernière, Victor, lui offre, sur insistance de Monique, un petit job bénévole dans son centre d’enfants exclus du système scolaire.  Waël se retrouve peu à peu responsable d’un groupe de six adolescents expulsés pour absentéisme, insolence ou encore port d’arme.  De cette rencontre explosive entre « mauvaises herbes » va naître un véritable miracle."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8oxVod26shq266pITtsskBLOuGW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sWPxNdAgKfTIeZ3H17EheDAsci6.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":498249,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8oxVod26shq266pITtsskBLOuGW.jpg","